  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project development objective is to strengthen the capacity of Statistics Mauritius to collect a comprehensive set of householddata, support and strengthen the analytical capacity of Statistics Mauritius, and enhance statistical data production and dissemination practices.</narrative>
